WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Can't stand it

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,000
Dad is furious

3
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,040
Why no news yet?

4
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,020
Don't stuff snow into your clothes

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,060
I feel a little uncomfortable when I move.

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:20,420
Got it, I’ll find Ling Yu and find our boss

7
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:24,260
Wait a minute. I'll call him Huang Ying. Why are you here?

8
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,660
This is the flight that Sister Ya took

9
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,060
The plane will land in Jiangcheng at eight o'clock tonight

10
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:30,860
I was supposed to pick him up at the airport, but I suddenly had something to do and couldn't think about it.

11
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,060
I still think it’s only appropriate for you to go

12
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:38,260
Remember not to be late. Sister Ya had something wrong with her body when she was in labor. She cannot be exposed to the cold. Just in case, you can bring this coat with you when the time comes. What are you doing in a daze?

13
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,060
I haven't rushed you to say thank you. Thank you. This is not enough.
